      <li><strong>Targeted Follow-up Search:</strong> Co-developed a targeted search for the GstLAL pipeline that folds external electromagnetic triggers (arrival time, sky location) into the likelihood-ratio detection ranking statistic as Bayesian priors, reducing the false-alarm rate of associated candidates by orders of magnitude at unchanged latency.</li>
